  message: "P3 REVIEW 2026-11-01 (dev 100b6fbb6e; owner-requested re-check of open P3 items last modified before 2026-10-20; fixtures under ~/hypergumbo_lab_notebook/p3_review_11012026/langs2/). VERDICT: PARTLY-STALE. 2026-11-01 review at dev 100b6fbb6e: object members are now fixed - import lila.core.perm.Granter / lila.security.Granter fixtures each bind Granter.check in the right package (WI-kipol 74ffde9e1f). Class shapes still fail: imported case class Literal(1).eval(), l: Literal then l.eval(), and nested TypeCheckResult.DataTypeMismatch(...).describe() all stay external with the import path in the module slot; the gokop Env fixture still resolves exactly 1 of 2 version() calls (TestSameNamedTypesInTwoPackages still asserts resolved == 1). Class symbols now record qualified_name incl. package+enclosing objects (62ac07d6a3); methods and objects record None. MECHANISM: scala member lookup keyed by simple name; class symbols now carry a package-qualified qualified_name but nothing re-targets through it, and methods/objects carry none. SHARES MECHANISM WITH: WI-kifim."  # e1a6
