unresolved, with the import path in the module slot. The right project symbol exists and is not reached.\n\nALSO WRONG, the other way: a member INHERITED through an object is withheld. sbt `import Def.{ScopedKey}` names `Init.ScopedKey`, which `object Def` inherits. In a random sample of 25 withholds this was 1 wrong withhold, and it is not fixed.\n\nASKED: give scala symbols a qualified name (package + enclosing types, including objects and package objects). Then use it to re-target as kotlin does. Measure the resolved-edge set on the scala cohort. Detekt's WI-kilap regression and the WI-tipoh tests must hold."  # 4eb2
